♪ <i>Now the sun</i> ♪

1145
01:58:06,208 --> 01:58:12,089
♪ <i>It falls into the sea</i> ♪

1146
01:58:12,673 --> 01:58:18,095
♪ <i>And around the only one for me</i> ♪

1147
