♪ <i>I was so green
And the dress you wore was yellow</i> ♪

1148
01:58:27,688 --> 01:58:30,858
♪ <i>And the world keeps turning</i> ♪

1149
01:58:32,151 --> 01:58:36,113
♪ <i>The world keeps turning</i> ♪

1150
01:58:36,739 --> 01:58:43,746
♪ <i>The sun is down
And the moon is in the meadow</i> ♪

1151
01:58:45,080 --> 01:58:49,168
♪ <i>And the world keeps turning</i> ♪

1152
01:58:49,793 --> 01:58:53,672
♪ <i>The world keeps turning</i> ♪

1153
01:58:55,758 --> 01:59:00,929
♪ <i>Put a hat on your head</i> ♪

1154
01:59:03,182 --> 01:59:05,476
♪ <i>Will you paint</i> ♪

1155
01:59:05,559 --> 01:59:11,106
♪ <i>The whole damned town red with me?</i> ♪

1156
01:59:11,815 --> 01:59:18,197
♪ <i>Well, the band has stopped playing
But we keep dancing</i> ♪

1157
01:59:19,782 --> 01:59:23,661
♪ <i>The world keeps turning</i> ♪

