♪ <i>On his hand
He wore the ring of another</i> ♪

1160
01:59:36,465 --> 01:59:39,760
♪ <i>The world keeps turning</i> ♪

1161
01:59:40,803 --> 01:59:44,932
♪ <i>The world keeps turning</i> ♪

1162
01:59:45,015 --> 01:59:49,311
♪ <i>The world keeps turning</i> ♪

1163
01:59:49,395 --> 01:59:53,774
♪ <i>The world keeps turning</i> ♪

1164
01:59:53,857 --> 01:59:58,028
♪ <i>The world keeps turning</i> ♪

1165
01:59:58,112 --> 02:00:03,951
♪ <i>The world keeps turning</i> ♪

